      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "The tinctures held. A few colonists are already back on their feet, grumbling like themselves again. Take the clinic's hazard pay before I spend it on more bottles.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
